<title>USA: Vacation Break U.S.A. says in merger talks.</title>
<headline>Vacation Break U.S.A. says in merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vacation Break U.S.A. Inc said Tuesday it is in preliminary discussions about a possible merger with an undisclosed company.</p>
<p>Vacation Break said the talks are still at an early stage, and it does not plan to issue any details until a definitive agreement is signed or the discussions end.</p>
<p>Vacation Break U.S.A. operates vacation ownership interests in resort properties in Florida and hotel interests in the Bahamas.</p>
